{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2022-10-05 17:00:00', 'title': 'ROLLINS, INC. SCHEDULES DATE FOR RELEASE OF THIRD QUARTER 2022 RESULTS', 'text': "ATLANTA , OCT. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROLLINS, INC. (NYSE: ROL), A PREMIER GLOBAL CONSUMER AND COMMERCIAL SERVICES COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL RELEASE ITS UNAUDITED THIRD QUARTER FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE PERIOD ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2022 ON WEDNESDAY, OCTOBER 26, 2022.\xa0 IN CONJUNCTION WITH ITS RELEASE, THE COMPANY WILL HOST A CONFERENCE CALL TO REVIEW THE COMPANY'S FINANCIAL AND OPERATING RESULTS ON WEDNESDAY, OCTOBER 26, 2022 AT 10:00 A.M."}